---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CTA from '../../components/CTA.astro';

const lang = 'en';
---
<Layout title="Cases" description="Virge.io case studies real projects, real results." lang={lang}>
  <div class="page-header">
    <h1>Our <span>Cases</span></h1>
    <p>Real-world projects we've delivered for our clients.</p>
  </div>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cases-grid">

        <a href={`/${lang}/cases/surf-orchestrator-core/`} class="case-card">
          <div class="case-card-visual case-card-visual--surf" aria-hidden="true">
            <img src="/images/cases/surf-orchestrator-core/surf-logo.png" alt="SURF" class="case-card-logo" />
            <span class="case-card-logo-divider"></span>
            <img src="/images/cases/surf-orchestrator-core/geant-logo.png" alt="GÉANT" class="case-card-logo" />
          </div>
          <div class="case-card-top">
            <span class="cases-eyebrow">Case Study</span>
            <div class="case-card-tags">
              <span class="tag">AI Search</span>
              <span class="tag">RAG</span>
              <span class="tag">Open Source</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3>SURF Hybrid Search</h3>
          <p>Schema-agnostic hybrid search for orchestrator-core, built with SURF and Tim Fröhlich. Funded by GÉANT. Shipped in v5.0 under Apache 2.0.</p>
          <div class="case-card-footer">
            <div class="case-card-meta">
              <span>Network orchestration</span>
              <span class="cases-dot">·</span>
              <span>pgvector · pg_trgm · PydanticAI</span>
            </div>
            <span class="cases-cta">Read case →</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href={`/${lang}/cases/jvj-selection/`} class="case-card">
          <div class="case-card-visual case-card-visual--white" aria-hidden="true">
            <img src="/images/cases/jvj-selection/shopvirge-logo.png" alt="ShopVirge" class="case-card-logo case-card-logo--square" />
            <span class="case-card-logo-x">×</span>
            <img src="/images/cases/jvj-selection/jvj-logo.png" alt="JVJ Selection" class="case-card-logo case-card-logo--square" />
          </div>
          <div class="case-card-top">
            <span class="cases-eyebrow">Case Study</span>
            <div class="case-card-tags">
              <span class="tag">eCommerce</span>
              <span class="tag">ShopVirge</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3>JVJ Selection</h3>
          <p>A referral-gated webshop for Jas voor Jeugd: a foundation that redistributes donated clothing to disadvantaged youth in Limburg. Only referred clients can check out.</p>
          <div class="case-card-footer">
            <div class="case-card-meta">
              <span>Social enterprise</span>
              <span class="cases-dot">·</span>
              <span>Next.js 14 · WFO · Stripe</span>
            </div>
            <span class="cases-cta">Read case →</span>
          </div>
        </a>

      </div>
      <CTA lang={lang} />
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .cases-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(100%, 360px), 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 2rem 0 4rem;
  }

  .case-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.04), rgba(255,255,255,0.01)),
      rgba(18,18,42,0.58);
    border: 1px solid rgba(108,92,231,0.18);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .case-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(168,85,247,0.45);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.28), 0 0 28px rgba(108,92,231,0.12);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .case-card-visual {
    min-height: 170px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 18% 20%, rgba(168,85,247,0.42), transparent 28%),
      linear-gradient(135deg, #4833b8 0%, #2593e5 100%);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .case-card-visual--surf {
    background: #fff;
  }

  .case-card-logo {
    max-height: 88px;
    max-width: 38%;
    object-fit: contain;
    opacity: 0.92;
  }

  .case-card-logo-divider {
    width: 3px;
    height: 110px;
    background: #000;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .case-card-logo-x {
    font-size: 4rem;
    font-weight: 100;
    color: #000;
    margin: 0 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .case-card-visual--white {
    background: #fff;
  }

  .case-card-logo--square {
    max-height: 88px;
    max-width: 88px;
  }

  .case-card-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .case-card-tags {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .case-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .case-card p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .case-card-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 0.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(108,92,231,0.1);
  }

  .case-card-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
</style>
